%% Owner: docs/19-frontend.md — one question from click to highlighted page, with what flows at each step.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (browser)
    participant S as Streamlit server (ui/app.py)
    participant A as FastAPI
    participant L as LLM (Groq)
    U->>S: click Ask (question, companies, years, k)
    S->>A: POST /query/stream (JSON)
    A-->>S: event: sources (top-k chunks)
    Note over S: t_sources (client clock)
    A->>L: instructions + fenced sources
    L-->>A: tokens
    A-->>S: event: delta … (after refusal gate + output policy)
    Note over S: t_first_delta
    S-->>U: re-render answer text (websocket)
    A-->>S: event: answer (citations, usage, quarantined)
    S-->>U: answer + citation expanders + timings
    U->>S: toggle "Show the PDF page" on [1]
    S->>A: GET /chunks/{id}/page.png
    A-->>S: PNG (page with chunk's blocks highlighted)
    S-->>U: image
